  {
   "text": "6. In the chapter on 'houses' the effects of these have already been described ",
   "bbox": [
    121,
    382,
    556,
    398
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "in a collective manner. It is only the effects on the houses of those that have been ",
   "bbox": [
    85,
    407,
    556,
    422
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "left out there, will be described here in detail.",
   "bbox": [
    85,
    431,
    339,
    446
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "7. Nevertheless, some special effects of Gulika (Mandi) and other Upagrahas ",
   "bbox": [
    121,
    455,
    556,
    470
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "which have been described by the ancient learneds, are enumerated here iri brief.",
   "bbox": [
    85,
    479,
    538,
    494
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "8. If Gulika be in the Lagna, the native will be a thief, cruel and devoid of ",
   "bbox": [
    121,
    503,
    556,
    519
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "politeness. He will not be very fat. He will have defects in his eyes. He will have ",
   "bbox": [
    85,
    527,
    556,
    543
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "few issues and little intelligence. He will not take interest in the study of Vedas and ",
   "bbox": [
    85,
    551,
    556,
    567
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "Shastras. He will eat much but will be unhappy . He does not live long. He will be ",
   "bbox": [
    85,
    576,
    556,
    591
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "of angry temperament, stupid and a coward. He will be lustful and deprived.",
   "bbox": [
    85,
    600,
    512,
    615
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "9. If Gulika be in the 2nd house, the native will not have a pleasant manner ",
   "bbox": [
    121,
    624,
    556,
    639
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "of speech. He will be quarrelsome and will ever remain short of wealth and grain. ",
   "bbox": [
    85,
    648,
    556,
    664
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "He will mostly live away from his native place. He will not stick to his word and ",
   "bbox": [
    85,
    672,
    556,
    688
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "will be incapable of discussing things in which the use of intellect is necessary.",
   "bbox": [
    85,
    696,
    528,
    712
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "10. If Gulika be in the 3rd house, the native will be greedy and voitable. He ",
   "bbox": [
    121,
    720,
    556,
    736
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "will generally like to lead a lonely life. He will be very fond of liquors. He will get ",
   "bbox": [
    85,
    745,
    556,
    760
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "little happiness from brothers and sisters.",
   "bbox": [
    85,
    769,
    315,
    784
   ]
